+# Copy to client/.env before `npm run build`. These values end up in the public JavaScript, which is
+# fine: a Google Analytics measurement ID is public by design. Never put passwords or API secrets here.
+
+# Google Analytics 4 measurement ID. Leave empty to run with no analytics at all.
+VITE_GA_ID=
